silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_5_P_f#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode5 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode5 is the contravariant lookup P(f): P(B) -> P(A), concretely the function recovering Mittens' owner Alice from the Mittens domestic-cat record. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P_f', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
